<title>BELGIUM: EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for the EU 15.</title>
<headline>EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for the EU 15.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for the 15 countries of the European Union, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 2.4	  2.8</p>
<p> Investment			 4.8	  6.3</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     2.2	  2.2</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    10.6	 10.3</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  2.9	  2.5</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  72.9	 72.3</p>
</text>
